Ijade kọ: (['a:b:'] - [':']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['-'] - ['--']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ([''] - ['--']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['--'] - ['']), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ([''] - ['']), ila-tuntun.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Ijade kọ: x, ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: y, ila-tuntun.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x rọpo: [''] pẹlu: ['xx'].
Ijade kọ: ((x ọkan-naa: y) boya: ['OK'] tabi: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), ila-tuntun.